Pointers and Structures
•C structure can be accessed in two ways in a C 
program
•Using normal structure variable
•Using pointer variable
•Dot(.) operator is used to access the data using normal 
structure variable
•arrow ( ->) is used to access the data using pointer 
variable 
•Let us see how to access structure data using pointer 
variable in a C program.
