•Then, “ Maths ” is assigned to union member “record1.subject”. Now, memory 
location name is changed to “record1.subject” with the value “ Maths ” (Union can 
hold only one member at a time).
•Then, “86.50” is assigned to union member “record1.percentage”. Now, memory 
location name is changed to “record1.percentage” with value “86.50”.
